 h J Athletics Canada to host public viewings of Japan at this summer’s t
 ournament as they take on the Netherlands\, Tunisia\, and Sweden. Bring yo
 ur friends and family to celebrate a summer of soccer in a fun\, community
  atmosphere. Each event will feature a variety of activities including int
 eractive games\, raffle prizes\, a beer garden\, and food and marketplace 
 vendors. Admission is free for all games\, and everyone is welcome to join
 ! Join us at the JCCC as we support Team Japan! Stay tuned for more detail
 s and we’ll see you there! Volunteer Opportunities Check out the link be
 low and create a profile to volunteer for these games! Volunteer Event Sch
 edule Game 1: Japan vs. Netherlands Sunday June 14\, 2026 Activities & ven
 dors: 12:00pm DJ Ryo: 1:00 - 7:00pm (no DJ during gameplay) Firefighters M
 eet & Greet: 3:00pm Kick-off: 4:00pm Maximum Capacity reached! More Info &
  RSVP Game 2: Japan vs. Tunisia Saturday June 20 / Sunday June 21\, 2026 A
 ctivities & vendors: 9:00pm (June 20) DJ Ryo: 10:00pm - 12:30am (no DJ dur
 ing gameplay) Kick-off: 12:00am (MIDNIGHT June 21) Maximum Capacity reache
 d! More Info & RSVP Game 3: Japan vs. Sweden Thursday June 25\, 2026 Activ
 ities & vendors: 4:00pm DJ Ryo: 5:00 - 10:00pm (no DJ during gameplay) Kic
