BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:JCCC Natsu Matsuri & Toronto Buddhist Church Bon Odori 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T210000
UID:468221297cba1de0c625be72e70682c0@jccc.on.ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the JCCC’s annual Natsu Matsuri & Bon Odori\, pr
 esented in collaboration with the Toronto Buddhist Church. This beloved su
 mmer tradition celebrates the spirit of Obon through food\, music\, perfor
 mances\, games\, and community gathering. A highlight of the festival is t
 he Bon Odori dance\, to take place at 7pm\, where everyone is invited to p
 articipate and celebrate together. Weather permitting\, festivities will b
 e held outdoors in the JCCC parking lot\, with Kobayashi Hall serving as t
 he indoor venue in case of rain. We look forward to celebrating with famil
 iar faces and new friends alike. See you there! More information to come\,
  keep an eye on this page!\n\nCategories: Community Event
LOCATION:Japanese Canadian Cultural Centre
URL:https://jccc.on.ca/event/2026/07/jccc-natsu-matsuri-toronto-buddhist-c
 hurch-bon-odori-2026
